      "Prefer official APIs, repositories, or downloadable archives over unbounded page crawling.",
      "Respect robots.txt, terms, licenses, rate limits, and attribution requirements.",
      "Cache raw responses immutably and record URL, retrieval time, response hash, and parser version.",
      "Do not collect credentials, private data, or user-submitted SQL without explicit permission.",
      "Normalize and deduplicate by family, schema digest, SQL digest, and mutation lineage before splitting.",
      "External records without trustworthy schema or dialect provenance may be reference-only and cannot support semantic verification."
    ],
    "freeze_rule": "Create the hidden partition only after the implementation and public evaluation snapshot are frozen. Optimization jobs may consume train/public but must never read hidden rows or hidden labels."
